nt variables required for this model on A100?\n* Is CPU offloading of the PLE embeddings supported/recommended in this setup?\n* Are there any known limitations of `Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-FP8` with vLLM 0.30.0 on A100?\n* What configuration would you recommend for maximizing throughput on 2× A100 80GB?\n\nI’d also appreciate a working Docker command or a reference configuration if one is available.\n\nThanks!\n\n\n### Before submitting a new issue...\n\n- [x] Make sure you already searched for relevant issues, and asked the chatbot living at the bottom right corner of the [documentation page](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/), which can answer lots of frequently asked questions.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59897/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/59897/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/62252","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/62252/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/62252/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/62252/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/62252","id":5906310540,"node_id":"I_kwDOI7xefs8AAAABYAsljA","number":62252,"title":"[Bug]: Tool-call argument coercion turns string values such as \"0017\" into integers for [\"string\", \"integer\"] parameters","user":{"login":"yifanxiong272","id":283968441,"node_id":"U_kgDOEO0DuQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/283968441?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yifanxiong272","html_url":"https://github.com/yifanxiong272","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/us